The source code used to build the INTEST Model  is called ModelGen Source (MGS). 
The tool used to build this model is called ModelGen.

In this release note we track the revision history of the MGS and 
the INTEST model.


1.ModelGen Source Revision History
==================================

04/04/2002 GW MGS 1.00rel0
--------------------------
This INTEST model is based on a TSMC 0.18 process netlist of ARM946EJ.
It has 8k I-cache and 8k D-cache.


18/07/2002 EM MGS 1.01rel0
--------------------------
* Timing arcs fixed
* All the timing data in .tdef file are "1", used as place holder.

2. Model revision History
=========================

  date    User       Version                History
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5Apr2002  gw  LF000-MG-22602-1.00rel0    INTEST model of ARM946, based on MGS 00rel0
24Jul2002  em  LF000-MG-22602-1.01rel0    INTEST model of ARM946E_88 - Built with ModelGen 4.3.2 -  Model based on MGS 1.01rel0
